src/medcouple.cpp adapts the code imported into PhylteR from mrfDepth in
July 2023: P. Segaert, with original code by M. Maechler and G. Brys.
Unneeded Eigen declarations were removed and work buffers use RAII.

The complete-link clustering implementation follows the tie and ordering
semantics of R's stats/src/hclust.f, by F. Murtagh and R contributors.
https://github.com/wch/r-source/blob/trunk/src/library/stats/src/hclust.f

